  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2: new package BeeAppie.Maui.MTAdmob, which shows your promos in banner slots AdMob could not fill: add builder.UseBeeAppiePromos() after UseMauiMTAdmob() and UseBeeAppie(...), and every MTAdView gets the fallback (MTAdmob 3.1 or later). Which promos show follows the app's promo settings in the dashboard, and views and taps in AdMob slots are counted apart. Fixed: a PromoBannerView in a slot lower than its own height (e.g. a 50-point ad slot) now fits the slot instead of being cut off. See https://beeappie.com/changelog for what changes in each version.",
